    {
      "id": "https://www.macrumors.com/2026/08/04/carplay-is-coming-to-pontoon-boats/",
      "url": "https://www.macrumors.com/2026/08/04/carplay-is-coming-to-pontoon-boats/",
      "title": "[MacRumors] CarPlay is Coming to Pontoon Boats",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://images.macrumors.com/t/Wb6Jjk2ALd5cN6_tB-9YPlurbss=/2000x/article-new/2026/08/carplay-pontoon-crest-balise.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://images.macrumors.com/t/Wb6Jjk2ALd5cN6_tB-9YPlurbss=/2000x/article-new/2026/08/carplay-pontoon-crest-balise.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://images.macrumors.com/t/Wb6Jjk2ALd5cN6_tB-9YPlurbss=/2000x/article-new/2026/08/carplay-pontoon-crest-balise.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://images.macrumors.com/t/Wb6Jjk2ALd5cN6_tB-9YPlurbss=/2000x/article-new/2026/08/carplay-pontoon-crest-balise.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\nMasterCraft Boat Holdings <a href=\"https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260804925738/en/CarPlay-Arrives-at-the-Helm-Crest-Marine-and-Balise-Pontoons-Partner-With-Savvy-Navvy-on-Industry-First\">today said</a> it is adding <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/carplay/\">CarPlay</a> to its upcoming Crest and Balise Pontoons. The company is working with Savvy Navvy to bring &zwnj;CarPlay&zwnj; and on-water navigation to boaters.\n<br />\n\n<br />\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-1058610\" height=\"1124\" src=\"https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/08/carplay-pontoon-crest-balise.jpg\" width=\"2000\" />\n<br />\nBoaters who purchase select 2027 Crest or Balise pontoons will have access to &zwnj;CarPlay&zwnj;, with many of the same features that are available in a car. The Savvy Navvy mobile app will integrate with &zwnj;CarPlay&zwnj; to show nautical charts, GPS tracking, smart routing, and live weather forecasts right alongside other &zwnj;CarPlay&zwnj; apps.\n<br />\n\n<br />\nSavvy Navvy will provide water navigation, a feature that is not available through the <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/guide/apple-maps/\">Apple Maps</a> &zwnj;CarPlay&zwnj; integration.\n<br />\n<blockquote>\"Boaters have been asking for a modern infotainment system for years,\" says Jelte Liebrand, Founder and CEO of Savvy Navvy. \"Plan your trip on the couch, step aboard, and it is already at the helm. No complicated ways to synchronise things; it just works. Savvy Navvy for CarPlay works on iOS and Android with any compatible display. I'm thrilled to see Crest and Balise put CarPlay in front of their boaters.\"</blockquote>\n<br />\nStarting with the 2027 model year, Apple &zwnj;CarPlay&zwnj; with Savvy Navvy will come standard on all new Balise and Crest Conquest and Caribbean models. A limited Savvy Navvy Premium subscription is included.\n<br />\n\n<br />\nThe Savvy Navvy app is available for &zwnj;CarPlay&zwnj; worldwide starting today, and it works with any compatible &zwnj;CarPlay&zwnj; display, including aftermarket marine head units.<div class=\"linkback\">Related Roundup: <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/carplay/\">CarPlay</a></div><div class=\"linkback\">Related Forum: <a href=\"https://forums.macrumors.com/forums/homepod-homekit-carplay-home-auto-technology.193\">HomePod, HomeKit, CarPlay, Home & Auto Technology</a></div><br />This article, &quot;<a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/2026/08/04/carplay-is-coming-to-pontoon-boats/\">CarPlay is Coming to Pontoon Boats</a>&quot; first appeared on <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com\">MacRumors.com</a><br /><br /><a href=\"https://forums.macrumors.com/threads/carplay-is-coming-to-pontoon-boats.2486432/\">Discuss this article</a> in our forums<br /><br />",
      "date_published": "2026-08-04T23:49:52+00:00",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "MacRumors",
          "url": "https://www.macrumors.com"
        }
      ],
      "image": "https://images.macrumors.com/t/Wb6Jjk2ALd5cN6_tB-9YPlurbss=/2000x/article-new/2026/08/carplay-pontoon-crest-balise.jpg",
      "_score": 18,
      "_quality": 0,
      "_relevance": 0,
      "_local_score": 0
    },
